B/sampt: Sample Template.

@Purpose: A tiny template exercising the Inform 6 template grammar.

@-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@p Introduction.
This paragraph is commentary with |code words| and $math$ and \centerline{a centred line}.
Values like {MAX_SCORE} are spliced in by Inform 7.

@c
[ SampleTemplateRoutine x;
  ! Ordinary Inform 6 inside a code paragraph.
  print (string) {NAME_STRING}, "^";
  return x + 1;
];

@p Another paragraph.
With {\it italic} text.
